0.08 0.11 0.18 rg BT /F1 8.6 Tf 56.0 582.0 Td (six core quantities: \(1\) Narrative DNA \(signed tripartite graph\), \(2\) Shannon Narrative Entropy H\(t\) in bits, \(3\) Narrative Energy E\(t\)) Tj ET
