0.08 0.11 0.18 rg BT /F1 8.6 Tf 48.0 504.8 Td (and social state dynamics requires falsifiable mathematical operators. Naive multiplicative formulas such as E = Intensity x Coherence x) Tj ET
0.08 0.11 0.18 rg BT /F1 8.6 Tf 48.0 494.6 Td (Repetition x Identification fail dimensional analysis and collapse to zero whenever any single factor vanishes.) Tj ET
0.08 0.11 0.18 rg BT /F1 8.6 Tf 48.0 484.4 Td (To establish Narrative Systems Engineering \(NSE\) as a rigorous engineering discipline, Argon.Engine v0.3 enforces four axioms:) Tj ET
0.08 0.11 0.18 rg BT /F1 8.6 Tf 48.0 474.2 Td (  \(1\) Signal Grounding: Direct derivation from physical PCM16 audio samples, 64x64 RGB24 rasters, and time-aligned speech segments.) Tj ET
0.08 0.11 0.18 rg BT /F1 8.6 Tf 48.0 464.0 Td (  \(2\) Stated Units & Bounds: Entropy and visual divergence in Shannon bits, audio in dBFS, and state trajectories in [-1, 1]^K.) Tj ET
0.08 0.11 0.18 rg BT /F1 8.6 Tf 48.0 453.8 Td (  \(3\) Layer Separation: Strict separation between observable media signal u\(t\), normative stance coding z\(t\), and state response x\(t\).) Tj ET
0.08 0.11 0.18 rg BT /F1 8.6 Tf 48.0 443.6 Td (  \(4\) Executable Reproducibility: Deterministic verification via automated invariant test suites \(Verify-Argon.ps1\).) Tj ET
